      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-29T18:38:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Building on Gwendal\u0027s comment, \"filter\" doesn\u0027t just apply to high/low/band-pass filters. It can also mean filtering out elements from a list to include/exclude matches, which is completely separate from this type of work.\n\nThese functions should indicate they are frequency-type filters, independent of the algorithm used to perform that work.\n\nThis applies to the name of the file as well, not just the functions/structs/etc.",
      "parentUuid": "dd16e354_50534d35",
      "revId": "f4117c9a1f37c174610e10667a2cbd877d40a900",
